  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.8.0\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Updated CorrespondenceClient authentication by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1464\n* Add endpoint for updating tags on a dataElement by @cammiida in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1451\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Fix referrer-policy security header spelling by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1447\n* Make ValidationSource virtual in GenericFormDataValidator by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1435\n* Implement  support in  by @danielskovli in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1472\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* Update mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspnet:8.0-alpine Docker digest to 8f4ced9 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1387\n* Update mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:8.0 Docker digest to 3cef193 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1388\n* Update mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:8.0-alpine Docker digest to cd6c810 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1392\n* Update github/codeql-action digest to 192325c by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1440\n* Update actions/checkout action to v5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1458\n* Update actions/setup-java action to v5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1459\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1441\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (minor) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1393\n### Other Changes\n* Remove AccountController by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1445\n* Also interpret 'altinn3local.no' as running in localtest by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1465\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.7.2...v8.8.0",
